	ShadowOffsetAdjustFactor, ShadowOffsetPower, MaskShadowOffsetStrength, \
	LightOffset_Pitch, SolidShadow_RampPosition, RampIndex, RampInt, SolidShadowStrength, \
	AniSwitch_ShadowColorBright, Desaturation, OpacityIntensity, ToonRimWidth, SSAOSkinIntensity, SSAOIntensity, \
