	SparkleIntensity, SparkleIntensityMax, SparkleColorful, SparkleStep, HueShiftValue, SparkleStrengthFOV, UseSparkleFOVStrength, \
	DisturebanceUVParameter, DisturebanceNoise_Tilling, MilkWay_Tilling_X, MilkWay_Tilling_Y, HeightRatioInput, MilkWay_Intensity, \
